Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:23.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:33.000
teresa: a week or two in advance. I don't always know when we can do tours, because it's based a lot on her schedule, uh, or mine.

