Whitney Hodges: Got it.

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:33.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:38.000
