00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:42.000
teresa: And I schedule the tour based on what we know is available, instead of them just.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:47.000
