00:25:40.000 --> 00:25:41.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:45.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. OK. I love that idea. Yeah.

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:47.000
