00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:57.000
Whitney Hodges: Right, yeah. And so, do you find that you have a lot of people that will book during the tour, or are you putting most people into the follow-up sequence following the tour?

00:25:56.000 --> 00:26:09.000
teresa: Probably 25% book at the tour, but we have at least a 50% booking rate from the tours. I really like to pre-qualify before and make sure that.

00:25:59.000 --> 00:26:02.000
Whitney Hodges: Nice!

00:26:04.000 --> 00:26:06.000
Whitney Hodges: That's awesome.

00:26:08.000 --> 00:26:10.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:09.000 --> 00:26:15.000
