00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:16.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:15.000 --> 00:26:18.000
teresa: And if they say, well, we've got 175.

00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:20.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:26.000
teresa: I've tried to give them tours. They're like, well, it could be less. You know, we might… if we really love it, we may take people off. They don't do.

00:26:25.000 --> 00:26:27.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, yeah.

00:26:26.000 --> 00:26:33.000
teresa: So, I've learned I just try to shut it down before, because they're not gonna uninvite 25 people, you know.

00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:30.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:41.000
Whitney Hodges: Right. Yeah. So how are you doing that pre-qualification at this point? Are you having like a phone call with them or do you have them fill out a pre-tour survey? What are you doing?

00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:53.000
teresa: Yes, I'll normally ask, um, in the sequence, if they, like, ask me a question, then I'll say, or if they're, like, um, usually if they're pretty interested, they'll ask me something.

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:49.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:53.000 --> 00:26:54.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:26:53.000 --> 00:27:06.000
teresa: And instead of a bot or something, I answer it myself. And so I'll jump in and I'll say, well, how many guests do you expect? Or are you looking at for a specific date that I could check for you? And then we kind of get a conversation going that way.

00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:58.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Nice.

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:01.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:04.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:07.000
Whitney Hodges: Love it.

00:27:06.000 --> 00:27:07.000
teresa: Um.

00:27:07.000 --> 00:27:13.000
teresa: So that's typically… and so if they're like, oh, I've got 200 guests, then I'm like, eh.

00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:09.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:27:12.000 --> 00:27:14.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Right.

00:27:13.000 --> 00:27:18.000
teresa: But I can get a good feel before they book a tour.

00:27:17.000 --> 00:27:30.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Okay. Sounds good. Anything else that you can think of that you're using Nurture Pro for? Are you using it to collect reviews or, um, you know, anything else?

