00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:27.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, yeah, yeah. Well, there, I mean, there's there's definitely more right that could be done. You know, with the system depending on how you'd like to to use it. It could be kind of the the review collection, as I mentioned, or you know, it also could be.

