Whitney Hodges: Um, well, I know you're, you know, in the vault, you're part of the Meta Ads Accelerator program, right? So you've probably seen some of my trainings on, or Jacqueline's trainings on, you know, creating, uh, landing pages specifically for your ads traffic. So landing pages like that could be created, um, you know, inside of LeadLock if you ever wanted to go down that road, you know, as opposed to having them on the website.

