Whitney Hodges: Yeah, you can. Yeah, you can build landing pages. I mean, you know, funnels. And I find that it's really kind of user friendly and sometimes more user friendly than like kind of, you know, the fancy websites that you may have paid a designer to set up for you. So some of our clients will use it.

