Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:52.000
Whitney Hodges: So you should, yeah, you should be able to export all of your opportunities. Now we will need to take a look inside of your account to make sure that that option isn't locked to where you have the ability to do that on your own, right? In the event that you don't, you would just reach out to Jesse and ask him to export all of those contacts.

