00:34:12.000 --> 00:34:29.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, I think it just could kind of be a way for it to feel a little bit more custom, right, and on brand for you, and for there to be easy ways, right, if one of your daughters spots an area of opportunity, for there to be a quick fix, right, not just to have to.

00:34:13.000 --> 00:34:15.000
teresa: Yep.

